sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser SPA
    participant A as REST API
    participant M as Session Manager
    participant W as Workers
    B->>A: GET /api/sessions (poll 1.5 s)
    A-->>B: snapshots + fleet
    B->>A: POST /start
    A->>M: validate > budget > gate > cache
    M->>W: ramp workers per phase
    W-->>M: live metrics
    A-->>B: Running: TPS, latency
